; What our advapi32.dll exports (docs/abi/windows.md W8 step 4): every name must be
; defined in advapi32.c. A program importing anything else is bound to one of
; ntdll's named stubs and says which when it calls it.
LIBRARY advapi32.dll
EXPORTS
AdjustTokenPrivileges
AllocateAndInitializeSid
FreeSid
InitializeSecurityDescriptor
LookupPrivilegeValueA
OpenProcessToken
RegCloseKey
RegConnectRegistryA
RegConnectRegistryW
RegCopyTreeA
RegCopyTreeW
RegCreateKeyA
RegCreateKeyExA
RegCreateKeyExW
RegCreateKeyW
RegDeleteKeyA
RegDeleteKeyExA
RegDeleteKeyExW
RegDeleteKeyValueA
RegDeleteKeyValueW
RegDeleteKeyW
RegDeleteTreeA
RegDeleteTreeW
RegDeleteValueA
RegDeleteValueW
RegEnumKeyA
RegEnumKeyExA
RegEnumKeyExW
RegEnumKeyW
RegEnumValueA
RegEnumValueW
RegFlushKey
RegGetValueA
RegGetValueW
RegLoadAppKeyA
RegLoadKeyA
RegLoadMUIStringA
RegLoadMUIStringW
RegNotifyChangeKeyValue
RegOpenCurrentUser
RegOpenKeyA
RegOpenKeyExA
RegOpenKeyExW
RegOpenKeyW
RegQueryInfoKeyA
RegQueryInfoKeyW
RegQueryValueA
RegQueryValueExA
RegQueryValueExW
RegQueryValueW
RegRenameKey
RegSaveKeyA
RegSetKeySecurity
RegSetKeyValueA
RegSetKeyValueW
RegSetValueA
RegSetValueExA
RegSetValueExW
RegSetValueW
RegUnLoadKeyA
SetSecurityDescriptorDacl
